#   Additional requests for further epochs> % <                                # STCSPEC
#                                                                              #
# SETUP AND SIGMAS OF STOCHASTIC PULSES                                        #
#   FRAME:    RSW> % <    DYX> % <       A priori sigma (in meters/sec**2)     # SPFR_RSW SPFR_DYX
#     Radial             > % <            > %%%%%%%%% <                        # ESTRAD  SIGRAD
#     Along track        > % <            > %%%%%%%%% <                        # ESTPRP  SIGPRP
#     Out of plane       > % <            > %%%%%%%%% <                        # ESTNOR  SIGNOR
#     Direction to Sun   > % <            > %%%%%%%%% <                        # ESTSUN  SIGSUN
#     Y-direction        > % <            > %%%%%%%%% <                        # ESTYDIR SIGYDIR
#     X-direction        > % <            > %%%%%%%%% <                        # ESTXDIR SIGXDIR
#                                                                              #
# SATELLITE-SPECIFIC PARAMETER SETUP                                           #
# > PRN Par/day _Sigma1_ _Sigma2_ _Sigma3_    <specific PRNs:                  # SATGROUP
#                                               99 all satellites (default)    #
#                                               98 only for eclipsing satellites #
#                                               97 one hour after eclipse      #
#                                               96 middle of eclipse period    #
#                                               95 all satellites at orbit midnight#
#                                                see 'help' for more details   #
# END_PANEL ####################################################################


