#   Receiver clock consistent to  > %%%%%%%% < > %%%%%%%%% < > %%%%%%%%%%%%% < # OSBDAT OSBTYP OSBIND
#                                                                              #
#   Estimate receiver code biases specific to:                                 #
#                                  Satellites considered in SATELLITE mode     #
#     GPS@@@@@@ > %%%%%%%%% <    > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <   # OSBREC_G OSBIND_G
#     GLONASS@@ > %%%%%%%%% <    > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <   # OSBREC_R OSBIND_R
#     Galileo@@ > %%%%%%%%% <    > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <   # OSBREC_E OSBIND_E
#     BeiDou@@@ > %%%%%%%%% <    > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <   # OSBREC_C OSBIND_C
#     QZSS@@@@@ > %%%%%%%%% <    > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <   # OSBREC_J OSBIND_J
#     SBAS@@@@@ > %%%%%%%%% <    > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <   # OSBREC_S OSBIND_S
#                                                                              #
#   Parameter spacing                        > %%%%%%%% < (hh mm ss)           # OSBINT
#   A priori sigma for satellites biases     > %%%%%%%% < nanoseconds          # OSBSIGS
#   A priori sigma for receivers@ biases     > %%%%%%%% < nanoseconds          # OSBSIGR
#                                                                              #
#   Alarming limit for receiver code biases  > %%%%%%%% < nanoseconds          # IFBMAX
#   Extend bias parameter validity interval  > %%%%%%%% < (hh mm ss)           # OSBVAL
#                                                                              #
#                                                                              #
